<section><h2 class="st-sec-title">Connections (6)</h2><ul class="st-ties"><li><span>Zaporozhian Sich was a vassal of <a href="/empire/polish-lithuanian-commonwealth">Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth</a></span><span class="dt">1572 CE – 1648 CE</span></li><li><span>Zaporozhian Sich was part of <a href="/state/cossack-hetmanate">Cossack Hetmanate</a></span><span class="dt">1649 CE – 1667 CE</span></li><li><span>Zaporozhian Sich was a vassal of <a href="/empire/tsardom-of-russia">Tsardom of Russia</a></span><span class="dt">1667 CE – 1709 CE</span></li><li><span>Zaporozhian Sich was a vassal of <a href="/empire/crimean-khanate">Crimean Khanate</a></span><span class="dt">1711 CE – 1734 CE</span></li><li><span>Zaporozhian Sich was a vassal of <a href="/empire/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a></span><span class="dt">1734 CE – 1775 CE</span></li><li><span>Zaporozhian Sich was conquered by <a href="/empire/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a></span><span class="dt">1775 CE</span></li></ul></section>
